---
description: APPLY wagmi v3 best practices WHEN using wagmi v3. This rule covers v3-specific differences only. For general wagmi patterns, refer to 3-wagmi@2.mdc. Includes migration notes and v3-specific hook changes.
globs: apps/frontend/**/*.tsx, apps/frontend/**/*.ts, **/*wagmi*.ts, **/*wagmi*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- Do not mix v2 and v3 hooks in the same codebase

Migration from v2:
- Review wagmi v3 migration guide before upgrading
- Update hook imports to v3 patterns
- Test all wallet interactions after migration
- Verify chain configuration compatibility
- Update transport configuration if needed
- Review breaking changes in v3 changelog

v3-Specific Hook Changes:
- Use v3 hook names and signatures
- Follow v3 hook patterns for reads and writes
- Update transaction handling to v3 patterns
- Use v3 account and chain hooks
- Adapt to v3 configuration structure
- Update error handling for v3 patterns

v3 Configuration:
- Use v3 config structure
- Update transport configuration
- Verify chain definitions compatibility
- Test configuration with v3 patterns
- Review v3-specific configuration options

v3-Specific Features:
- Use v3-specific features when available
- Follow v3 best practices for new features
- Avoid deprecated v2 patterns in v3
- Leverage v3 performance improvements
- Use v3 type improvements
